From 7c6f0d88c1ce7a51389fa74bba39842637628647 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 13:46:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 16/29] fix-mr-3: MR-38/MR-33 fixed-term pay of unstated
 length, MR-37 stated annual figure, MR-29 departments note, MR-39 headline
 median basis

- MR-38: shared.js isTermUnstated: an internship paid per hour/day/week/month with no stated length is fixed-term
  pay (isFixedTerm); app.js postedTerm(s, job) shows it as posted, Juice per month while it lasts, no rank pool.
- MR-33: the drawer's converted line converts fixed-term pay at the posted interval (approxLine).
- MR-37: annualNote explains a stated annual figure (statedAnnual) with the posting's words and its payments.
- MR-29: the stats line's Details (the chart notes' Details) say Google's departments are read from titles.
- MR-39: stats() and Insights' summaryStats take the main currency's median when pay is in several currencies
  (mainPayCurrency, the chart rows' rule) and say where ("base pay median in the US").

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014jaqot5Ddmi7Co6CofBiyc
